Subject: [PATCH] ibus: allow Compose locale check while cross building

The XIM Compose locale path is unused in this disabled-XIM build, but
configure still hard-errors when AC_CHECK_FILE cannot run under cross compile.
Let it fall through to the default locale directory.

diff -ruN -U0 --exclude=*.bak a/configure b/configure
--- a/configure	2024-02-13 02:53:06
+++ b/configure	2026-07-05 00:29:47
@@ -20492 +20492 @@
-  as_fn_error $? "cannot check for file existence when cross compiling" "$LINENO" 5
+:
@@ -20514 +20514 @@
-  as_fn_error $? "cannot check for file existence when cross compiling" "$LINENO" 5
+:
